  "title": "A Gesture of Respect",
  "description": "As the young Tusken Raider shows off the head of the Tatooine sand ape, the Tusken basks in the adulation and attention from the incredibly proud tribesmen. As the youth tells the tale of the vanquishing of the beast, the tribe grows ever more excited, and Boba Fett looks on, enjoying the response. Then from Fett's side, the Tusken Raider chieftain appears in silent regality, offering him a drink from his black melon."
